# The Android Gradle build template (Godot 4.5.1 mono). Only the template's source is tracked:
# our GodotApp.java (the GL surface watchdog - see the phone section of CLAUDE.md), the Gradle
# files and the manifest. Everything below is either written by every export or is a large
# binary that tools/android-deploy.sh restores from the installed android_source.zip.

# Godot library AARs (from android_source.zip) and the .NET native libraries the export copies in.
build/libs/
# The exported game data, rewritten by every export.
build/assets/
build/assetPackInstallTime/src/
# Gradle outputs and caches.
build/build/
build/.gradle/
build/assetPackInstallTime/build/
